<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div type="jAn">       <head><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#aq">Uhland's Technicum</hi><lb/>
zu Frankenberg bei Chemnitz ( Sachsen ) .<lb/>
